== demo: Vitest for the rule, then @playwright/test runs (each a separate process) against an app server per worker ==

## 1. Unit tests of the domain rule (Vitest)
   concept: the rule that decides whether a change request is accepted is a pure function; its edge cases (90th vs 91st day, same kind vs other kind) are cheap to test exhaustively here, so the browser tests only need one journey per outcome
